# UI library

The frontend UI library is [shadcn/ui](https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui) (https://ui.shadcn.com).

Before adding, styling, composing, or debugging interface components, read and follow `.cursor/skills/shadcn/SKILL.md`.

- Install and update components with the shadcn CLI (`npx shadcn@latest`). Do not copy component source from GitHub by hand.
- Search the registry before writing custom markup.
- Use the shadcn MCP server in `.cursor/mcp.json` for registry search, docs, and install commands.
